  "description": "We all want to run away once life starts to become a burden. We think we'll be able to let it go once we run from it, but our thoughts never go easy on us. Face your worries and fight, or let it devour you. This is a story about a man who tries to avoid his angony, but ends up facing it.\n\n(Source: Toomics)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
